OL,3,GNEWSAPolice search for e-motorbike
OL,4,Ariders after fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FNottinghamshire Police has launched an
OL,7,Farson investigation into a series of
OL,8,Ffires officers believe were started by
OL,9,Fa group riding e-motorbikes.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid there had been a "stark rise" in
OL,13,Fthe number of wildfires in the
OL,14,FMansfield area.
OL,16,FSgt Lee Walker, of the Mansfield
OL,17,Fneighbourhood policing team, said: "It
OL,18,Fis believed some of the fires have been
OL,19,Fdeliberately lit by a group riding
OL,20,Fe-motorbikes around the area and
OL,21,Finvestigations are ongoing."
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
